/target
.techlead/
.DS_Store
*.local
.env*
# family-e2e live tier PATs (out-of-band creds for scripts/family-e2e.sh) — never tracked.
*.creds
# Owner's local legal-fill worksheet — prefilled scratch, never tracked.
/OWNER-LEGAL-FILLINS.html
.pass2-findings.json
# Agent worktrees (cold-review isolation) — transient, never tracked.
.claude/worktrees/

# Ephemeral cross-TL courier correspondence (audit trail kept on disk, not tracked)
docs/handoff/

# cargo-mutants working state. Both are produced in the working tree by the local
# repro documented in docs/TESTING.md, so they are ignored to keep tool output from
# being swept into a commit.
/mutants.out/
/pr.diff
/mutant-list.txt

# PR-body scratch files. PR metadata belongs in the PR, not the repository —
# committed at repo root it goes stale the moment the PR moves, and CLAUDE.md
# rules out committing working state.
WP-*-PR-BODY.md

# Content-addressed claim store written by a local analysis tool — live tool state on
# disk, never repo content. (227 of these were swept into this branch by a `git add -A`.)
.atlas/
